### chezmoi: intentionally local-only
# Coding agent configs stay off this public repo. They accumulate per-directory
# trust entries, MCP server definitions and project paths that point at work
# repos, and re-adding them keeps dragging that back in. Only the modify_
# templates, which own a fixed set of preference keys, are tracked.
dot_claude/*
!dot_claude/modify_settings.json
dot_codex/*
!dot_codex/modify_private_config.toml
dot_config/opencode/
# Machine-local shell config (see dot_zshrc).
dot_zsh.d/99-local.sh
